.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5AMuUltUAH8Q7kNvwEViqxc&_nc_oc=Adp6HDQ9YkyfodKgQrIE5VY4j7y5W2HaQ81BwZhxS2jXfZltvhEeCjg5b7Uz-pC7pb4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGL5GG4KFjKID5_MRHwhQ9PCX0pPFeVeRK4XlEFzad7XQ&oe=6A8ED017"}, "display_name": "PlayMaker", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment.\n\nKey Features:\n\nInteractive Strategy Creation: Design and manipulate soccer plays in 3D, offering in-depth tactical understanding.\n\nMixed Reality Meetups: Connect with friends or teammates in a virtual setting, ideal for discussing strategies or socializing.\n\nYouTube Integration: Analyze weekend matches in-app, facilitating group discussions and breakdowns of key game moments.\n\nMeta Avatar Customization: Personalize your meta avatar with team jerseys and accessories, enhancing engagement.\n\nReal-Time Collaboration: Work together in real-time, share ideas, and adjust tactics with teammates or coaches, irrespective of physical location.\n\nEnhanced Communication Tools: Utilize integrated voice chat and gesture recognition for natural, effortless team discussions.\n\nPlayMaker is more than just a tactical tool; it's a bridge between virtual and physical sports training, perfect for soccer teams and enthusiasts eager to leverage technology for an edge in their game.", "short_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rezzil.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rezzi